      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Per our [documentation](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/physbones#humanoid-bones), PhysBones shouldn't be on bones that are part of the [Humanoid armature definition!](https://docs.unity3d.com/2019.4/Documentation/Manual/class-Avatar.html)\nRegardless, since this appears to be a regression-- do you have a video or comparison of what it looked like before? What avatar ID are you observing this on?",
