      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: As for a video of what it looked like before, not really sense i don't record, and i can't really get one now cause of the update, and Im also not really sure where to get an avatar ID, though I'm observing it on a private avatar I made.\nIt basically allowed the wrist bone to rotate while also simulating physbone physics, but now it simply doesnt allow the wrist to rotate based on the controllers rotation, but the rest of the arm looks fine",
